  // ── §12 SUPERVISION LAYER — human governs ──
  supervision: {
    objective:   "'machine closes own control loop, WITH human STRATEGIC
                  supervision + decisions.' Axis 2 = machine-acts half;
                  THIS = human-governs half (today only 'emit algedonic +
                  HOLD')."
    ashby:       "human has FINITE variety; firehose exceeds it. Surface
                  must ATTENUATE to SHAPE + EXCEPTIONS, never raw stream.
