                  auto-resolves — double-loop LEARNING, A5 proper).",
      channel:   "verdict = SIGNED supervision_decision {escalation_id,
                  verdict, ts, by:rmw3, note, sig} in state.db + NATS
                  vsf.alpha.s5.decision. Holding loop VERIFIES signature
                  (chain to pinned S5-CA root) BEFORE acting; invalid →
